            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 6.4</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">New</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Seedream 5.5.</b> ByteDance's new image model in 1K, 1.5K and 2K with up to ten reference images. Choose a transparent or opaque background and save as PNG or JPEG.</li>
<li><b>Seedream 5.5 in Inpainting.</b> A third choice next to Ideogram 4.5 and Krea 3 when you replace a marked area.</li>
<li><b>Seedream 5.5 Layer Separation.</b> Split an image into up to 99 layers, set the maximum count and the resolution, and read the text of every text layer. You pay per delivered layer.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Improved</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Zoom while inpainting.</b> The mouse wheel and Command-scroll zoom toward the pointer, and two fingers on the trackpad move around the zoomed image.</li>
<li><b>Fresh mask after each run.</b> Once you start an inpaint or a removal, the mask is cleared so the next attempt starts clean. Your prompt stays.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
